        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako, mbundi muumi, mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu Leza wa-Israyeli, ncobeni Moabu uyooba mbuli Sodoma, abana ba-Amoni bayooba mbuli Gomora, itongo limenedwe mituntulwa, iizwide malindi aamunyo, iitakedwe lyoonse. Bantu bangu basyeede bayoobasaala, cisi cangu cisyeede ciyoobavuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
